title: EvelynVentressDungeon
---
Evelyn Ventress: When Evelyn walks into the room, she immediately detects the distinct smell of dried blood, which explains the dark splotches on the floor. She sees a cell door and walks inside.
->Reveal a disheveled man lying in the cell with her.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	From the corner of her eye, she sees the man and slowly approaches. “Sir, are you okay?” As she speaks these words, his body fades into air. 
->Have the stone roof begin to collapse. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Quickly, she retreats out of the cell. Wiping a bead of sweat from her forehead, she smiles, imagining herself as Indiana Jones at this moment. 
->Slam the door behind her.
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 1>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of Isolation
	“No no no no no no!” She lunges toward the bars, pulling hard but getting nowhere. Sweating, she collapses to the ground and stays there until the door cracks open once more.
->Reveal a little girl in the cell with her. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Evelyn looks over her shoulder and notices the child. Carefully, she approaches. “Hi, honey. How did you get here?” She reaches for the child’s arm as the apparition fades into air. 
